<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 500s</p><h1 class="research-title">The 6th century</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 500s, 266 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 93 were founded and 57 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Byzantine Empire, the Sasanian Empire and the Kingdom of the Franks.</p></header>
